  "notes": [
    "Conceptual model derived from two image references plus the supplied PDF/JSON, not a surveyed or approved site plan.",
    "The wide proportions of PLAN-01 take priority. The developed parcel is approximately 450 x 190 m, not the 250000 m2 / 550 m depth in the written brief.",
    "The model contains 220 furnished hotel room bays across three blocks, not a verified hotel key/area schedule or complete interior fit-out.",
    "The image-like villa cluster contains 18 villa buildings with private pools; the written target of 150 chalet/villa units is not achieved.",
    "Hotel room bays are schematic. Circulation cores, lifts, stairs, services, egress and accessible rooms require a coordinated plan.",
    "The beachfront club follows the drawing but its location relative to the legal coastal setback is unresolved. No valid setback distance is known or claimed.",
    "Dunes, shoreline, elevations and sea levels are illustrative. Flood, wave run-up, marine structures and coastal approvals have not been assessed.",
    "Services are placed at the rear east as in the masterplan. The brief contains inconsistent north/south wording; no prevailing wind or utility capacities are established.",
    "Guest paths, buggy loop and rear service lane are visually differentiated but not traffic-engineered.",
    "All vegetation consists of lightweight shared mesh components; no external textures are needed."
